---
description: Best practices for using Radix UI primitives
globs: **/*.{ts,tsx}
---
- Use Radix UI primitives as the foundation for your custom components.
- Implement proper accessibility features using Radix UI's built-in support.
- Customize the look and feel of Radix UI components using your own styles.
- Keep your Radix UI components modular and reusable throughout your application.
- Utilize Radix UI's state management utilities for complex component interactions.